{"id":"wb-6-890","name":"法国公议局旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"法国公议局旧址","text":"法国公议局旧址，又称原法国公议局大楼（法语：Hôtel municipal de la Concession française），该建筑位于当时的天津法租界克雷孟梭广场（Place Clemenceau）西侧（今天津市和平区承德道12号）。目前，法国公议局旧址被中华人民共和国国务院批准为全国重点文物保护单位，被天津市人民政府批准为特殊保护等级历史风貌建筑。现为天津文化局和天津文物局所在地。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%AC%E8%AE%AE%E5%B1%80%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93456737,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93456737","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cdb0024534d47867a35c2268.jpg","title":"20150223-法国公议局旧址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20150223-%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%AC%E8%AE%AE%E5%B1%80%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/20150223-%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E5%85%AC%E8%AE%AE%E5%B1%80%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Rudwig","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​1945年，驻天津日军曾在此地向美国海军陆战队投降","width":320,"height":150}}